facts:
**Translation** by the vector $\binom{a}{b}$ moves the point right $a$ and up $b$: $(x,y)\to(x+a,\,y+b)$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-2.9,0)--(2.9,0) node[right]{$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-2.9)--(0,2.9) node[above]{$y$};
\coordinate (P) at (-1.7,-0.6);
\coordinate (Q) at (0.9,-0.6);
\coordinate (Pp) at (0.9,1.2);
\draw[dashed,gray] (P)--(Q)--(Pp);
\draw[->,thick,blue] (P)--(Pp);
\fill (P) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below left] at (P) {$P(x,y)$};
\fill (Pp) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above=3pt,fill=white,inner sep=2pt] at (Pp) {$P'(x+a,\,y+b)$};
\node[below] at (-0.4,-0.6) {$a$};
\node[right] at (0.9,0.3) {$b$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

**Reflection in the $x$-axis** keeps $x$ and negates $y$: $(x,y)\to(x,\,-y)$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-2.9,0)--(2.9,0) node[right]{$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-2.9)--(0,2.9) node[above]{$y$};
\draw[very thick,red] (-2.6,0)--(2.6,0);
\coordinate (P) at (1.5,1.7);
\coordinate (Pp) at (1.5,-1.7);
\draw[dashed,gray] (P)--(Pp);
\fill (P) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right] at (P) {$P(x,y)$};
\fill (Pp) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below right] at (Pp) {$P'(x,\,-y)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

**Reflection in the $y$-axis** keeps $y$ and negates $x$: $(x,y)\to(-x,\,y)$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-2.9,0)--(2.9,0) node[right]{$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-2.9)--(0,2.9) node[above]{$y$};
\draw[very thick,red] (0,-2.6)--(0,2.6);
\coordinate (P) at (1.5,1.7);
\coordinate (Pp) at (-1.5,1.7);
\draw[dashed,gray] (P)--(Pp);
\fill (P) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right] at (P) {$P(x,y)$};
\fill (Pp) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above left] at (Pp) {$P'(-x,\,y)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

**Rotation $90^{\circ}$ anticlockwise** about the origin: $(x,y)\to(-y,\,x)$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{angles,quotes}
\draw[<->] (-2.9,0)--(2.9,0) node[right]{$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-2.9)--(0,2.9) node[above]{$y$};
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (P) at (1.8,1.0);
\coordinate (Pp) at (-1.0,1.8);
\draw[dashed,gray] (O)--(P);
\draw[dashed,gray] (O)--(Pp);
\pic[draw,->,thick,angle radius=1.55cm,angle eccentricity=1.5,"$90^{\circ}$"]{angle=P--O--Pp};
\fill (O) circle (2pt);
\fill (P) circle (2.5pt);
\node[right] at (P) {$P(x,y)$};
\fill (Pp) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above left] at (Pp) {$P'(-y,\,x)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

